==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|derogacion}} (French {{m|fr|dérogation}}), from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|derogatio}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˌdɛɹəˈɡeɪʃən/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An act which [[belittle]]s; [[disparagement]].
# {{lb|en|legal}} The act of [[derogating]]; the temporary or partial nullification of a law.

